ed_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"LuB-RHZQzmbAHXmykrN0BA","review_id":"4jth7u8Gi82GkxCpi0w1Iw","date":"2020-02-11T16:48:46","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9251914620399475,"text_excerpt":"What an interesting spot in the Bywater. This place screams \"local spot\" in every way. The barista knew several of the patrons by name, and many of them seemed to know each other. The owner had dinner with some people right there in the room. His cat was running in and around the area. As I left in the evening, the outdoor seating was completely taken up by a group of friends and their dogs. This is the sort of place I love, and I believe every community needs. It's not a Starbucks, or a PJs, and you need to understand that before you go. It isn't pristine or perfect. You can definitely score a delicious chai latte and pemesto (tomato, pesto, cream cheese) bagel, which I gladly did. Its d..."},{"business_id":"LuB-RHZQzmbAHXmykrN0BA","review_id":"35dJR7I6Mk9oEf3I_4gjUw","date":"2019-11-24T09:29:20","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9168113470077515,"text_excerpt":"My favorite coffee shop in the city. Funky little spot, with rad local art inside. Omar makes excellent dishes, with his random popups depending on the day. Great coffee, and they do a random array of juices as well. I particularly enjoyed the watermelon juice and the beet lemonade. Great spot for vegans as well. And a great venue to acquire information about all the local groups doing wonderful work in the area. Many college students frequent here to to their work, and shoot the freeze. You'll also see some cool stuff going on just having a drink outside, many parades and such converge on this location, right across from Mimi's. Been in my rotation for quite some time, for I am social bi..."},{"business_id":"LuB-RHZQzmbAHXmykrN0BA","review_id":"_-C-ErS8Prl4uErhcKRjXQ","date":"2021-07-15T18:45:39","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9142085909843445,"text_excerpt":"Lovely coffee shop that fits the charm of the Marigny neighborhood. When I walked in, there was someone casually playing the piano, that's in the cafe. It was delightful. Plenty of indoor and outdoor seating and some lush plants outside which adds to the vibe. The barista is very friendly. The coffee offerings are as you would expect and the prices are on point too. If you like the flavored coffees, this place has a full selection of choices. I enjoyed an iced hazelnut latte. Food offerings are good and seems like coming early to catch the breakfast options is best. I missed breakfast this time, so I'll have to check back. But... THE CURRY! Flora Cafe makes a house vegan curry over jasmin..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"LuB-RHZQzmbAHXmykrN0BA","photo_id":"fdGVCEu4FYIEvmlPu4zFbA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/fdGVCEu4FYIEvmlPu4zFbA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9166733026504517},{"business_id":"LuB-RHZQzmbAHXmykrN0BA","photo_id":"9NS4MUFQkAOX1-Xx8u_xWA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/9NS4MUFQkAOX1-Xx8u_xWA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8141430616378784},{"business_id":"LuB-RHZQzmbAHXmykrN0BA","photo_id":"c2upZcQqfBqG5pgbRvR8Mw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/c2upZcQqfBqG5pgbRvR8Mw.jpg","visua